Crawler Meat Drop
    Events
        Unit - A unit Dies
    Conditions
        (Owner of (Killing unit)) Not equal to Neutral Hostile
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Crab
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Hermit Crab
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Spider Crab Shorecrawler
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Spider Crab Limbripper
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Spider Crab Behemoth
    Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Random integer number between 1 and 10) Equal to 1
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet DyingUnitPos = (Position of (Dying unit))
                Item - Create Raw Crawler Meat at DyingUnitPos
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_DyingUnitPos)
            Else - Actions
